#basePath	Day1

:: ArrivalAtTheShed
@trigger    SceneReady
@who    Radio

$call SetInputState(false)
$call StopPuzzleMode()
$call StopOpenMode()
{@Astrid} Whoa. This place has really changed.
Elijah, where are you?

$call Wait(2)

$call MoveToCameraView("Right")
{@Radio} Star HQ to Station Seven. Elijah, do you copy?
Please log in and provide status update. 

$call Wait(2)

{@Astrid} Hi—um, this is Astrid, Elijah’s ... friend. Elijah’s not here.
$call Wait(1)
{@Astrid} Hello?
$call Wait(1)
{@Astrid} Ugh. They can’t hear me.
$call Wait(2)

{@Radio} Station Seven, please log in and report.

$call Wait(1)

{@Astrid} I can’t, I don’t know how ...

$call Wait(2)

{@Dad} Astrid, is that you?
$call Wait(1)

{@Astrid} Dad! I can’t believe it's you.
Are you still at the South Pole? Are you okay?
$call Wait(2)

{@Dad} This is a one-way radio, so you won’t be able to talk to us. But I have a feeling that’s you. Happy birthday, kiddo. 
I heard from your aunt Martha that you managed to track down Elijah’s address.
I’m sorry, Astrid ... I wish I could’ve warned you in time. 
Elijah’s not there. He probably won’t be back for a while.

$call Wait(2)

{@Astrid} What? 
$call Wait(1)
Why not? 
$call Wait(1)
Where is he? 
$call Wait(2)
Ugh, forgot ... you can’t hear me. 
$call Wait(2)

{@Dad} There’s not much time, so I’ll give you the short version.
My team here at IceCube has started an underground group called the STAR Coalition. We’re trying to rebuild our knowledge of the night sky. 
$call Wait(1)
It’s not easy ... so much was lost during the Collapse.
$call Wait(1)
But then Elijah reached out to us. He’s onto something big. It’s called Project Hercules. 
$call Wait(2)

{@Astrid} Project Hercules? 
$call Wait(1)

{@Dad} I’ll explain more later. For now, we need your help. 
Elijah has been working on a series of puzzles. I was hoping you could pick up where he left off.
$call Wait(2)

{@Astrid} Me? 
$call Wait(1)
Dad, I just got here. 
$call Wait(1)
I don’t know how any of this stuff works!
$call Wait(1)

{@Dad} See if you can find Elijah’s reference guide. It should have all the data you need.

{@Dad} Time’s up. I gotta go.
I’ll explain more later.
Love you, Little Bear. Good luck.
$call MoveToCameraView("Desk")
$call StartOpenMode()
$call SetInputState(true)

:: PointsUpdated
@trigger    PointsUpdated
@when   sciencePoints > 2
@once

$call StopOpenMode()
$call ClearMonitorSelection()
{@Radio} Star HQ to Station Seven.
The STAR Coalition has requests your assistance identifying starts in the Perseus constellation.
{@Radio} Please align your telescope to the Perseus region. 
$call StartPuzzleNavigation()

:: PuzzleNavigationComplete
@trigger    PuzzleNavigationComplete
@once

$call Wait(1)
$call StopPuzzleNavigation()
{@Radio} This task will require your astral color instrument. 
{@Radio} Unlocking now. Stand By...
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(ColorInstrument, true)
$call StartPuzzleMode()

:: PerseusPuzzleComplete
@trigger    CorrectPuzzleSubmission
@when   puzzleName == "Perseus"
@once

$call StopPuzzleMode()
{@Astrid} Time to turn in for the night.